== members of an ascribed signature are checked pairwise
digest: checks 3 (ascription 3) deps 3 (interface 3) equalities 0 omissions 0
check ascription M.Inner : <M.Inner'> members.ml:6:6-9:3
check ascription M.Other : <M.Other'> members.ml:6:6-9:3
check ascription M : <#1> members.ml:6:6-9:3
dep <M.Inner'> -interface-> S
dep <#1> -interface-> <M.Inner'>
dep <M> -interface-> <#1>
== nested members pair with each side's own declaration
digest: checks 2 (ascription 2) deps 6 (alias 1 interface 5) equalities 0 omissions 0
check ascription M.N : <M.N'> nestpair.ml:5:6-7:3
check ascription M : <#1> nestpair.ml:5:6-7:3
dep M.N.T@M.N -alias-> SB
dep M.N'.T'@M.N' -interface-> M.N.T@M.N
dep <#2> -interface-> M.N'.T'@M.N'
dep <M.N'> -interface-> <#2>
dep <#1> -interface-> <M.N'>
dep <M> -interface-> <#1>
== members reached through an include pair through the body
digest: checks 1 (ascription 1) deps 5 (alias 1 include 1 interface 3) equalities 0 omissions 0
check ascription M : <#1> incpair.ml:4:52-6:3
dep Base.T@Base -alias-> SB
dep Base.T@M -include-> Base.T@Base
dep M.T'@M -interface-> Base.T@M
dep <#1> -interface-> M.T'@M
dep <M> -interface-> <#1>
